  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "鲤鱼王的分类是鱼宝可梦，\n丑丑鱼的分类也是鱼宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9CA49C7C738B768452067C7B662F9C7C5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A4E114E119C7C768452067C7B4E5F662F9C7C5B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然而在密阿雷却看不到丑丑鱼，\n明明这两种都是鱼宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136800C57285BC6963F96F75374770B4E0D52304E114E119C7CFF0C000A660E660E8FD94E2479CD90FD662F9C7C5B9D53EF68A62026202600100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以如果你带着丑丑鱼的话，\n能不能把它让给我呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55982679C4F605E2677404E114E119C7C76848BDDFF0C000A80FD4E0D80FD628A5B838BA97ED962115462FF1F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意把丑丑鱼让给我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F628A4E114E119C7C8BA97ED962115417FF1F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "愿意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "613F610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要让给我的是哪只丑丑鱼呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818BA97ED962117684662F54EA53EA4E114E119C7C5462FF1F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请记得要把丑丑鱼让给我哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF78BB05F978981628A4E114E119C7C8BA97ED9621154E6FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是丑丑鱼！\n谢谢你！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F4E114E119C7CFF01000A8C228C224F60FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好大一只丑丑鱼呀！\n谢谢你！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D59274E0053EA4E114E119C7C5440FF01000A8C228C224F60FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "异色的丑丑鱼！？\n谢谢你！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F02827276844E114E119C7CFF01FF1F000A8C228C224F60FF01FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "头目！？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而且还是异色！？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n总感觉甚至都有点吓人了，\n但还是超级无敌感谢你！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "593476EEFF01FF1F00100001BE01000A800C4E148FD8662F5F028272FF01FF1F00100001BE01000A603B611F89C9751A81F390FD670970B954134EBA4E86FF0C000A4F468FD8662F8D857EA765E0654C611F8C224F60FF01FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "丑丑鱼，让我们好好相处吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E114E119C7CFF0C8BA962114EEC597D597D76F859045427FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真希望能和丑丑鱼\n变得更要好呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F5E0C671B80FD548C4E114E119C7C000A53D85F9766F48981597D5440FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吁～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5401FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了让丑丑鱼和鲤鱼王的关系变得更好，\n我把丑丑鱼放进了水池里！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868BA94E114E119C7C548C9CA49C7C738B768451737CFB53D85F9766F4597DFF0C000A6211628A4E114E119C7C653E8FDB4E866C346C6091CCFF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它们同样都是鱼宝可梦，\n应该可以搞好关系才对！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n话虽如此，我听说放养\n野生宝可梦时要格外小心。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834EEC540C683790FD662F9C7C5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A5E948BE553EF4EE5641E597D51737CFB624D5BF9FF0100100001BE01000A8BDD867D59826B64FF0C6211542C8BF4653E517B000A91CE751F5B9D53EF68A665F68981683C59165C0F5FC3300200100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过请你快看水池里！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n丑丑鱼和鲤鱼王\n看起来关系非常好！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
